{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"800cd0af-a615-4bfd-951a-886249dfcbd1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the Q5.2 problem:\n\n**Q5.2**: 在 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载下，硬件控制模块（指令调度 / warp scheduler / DMA控制器 / 命令处理器）和访存架构（多级Cache / HBM / 共享内存 / 寄存器文件 / Scratchpad）如何支持多算子/微算子并发的调度、同步和数据供给？关键设计方法有哪些？\n\n**预关键词**: warp scheduler, DMA controller, command processor, instruction dispatch, memory hierarchy, HBM, shared memory, register file, scratchpad memory, L1/L2 cache, memory bandwidth, data prefetching, double buffering, async copy, memory coalescing, bank conflict avoidance, synchronization primitive, barrier, TLB, MMU, MoE expert weight prefetch, DiT denoising step memory footprint, multimodal cross-modal memory access, video frame buffer management\n\n**侧重**: 硬件架构和运行时\n**侧重配置**: {\"label\":\"硬件架构和运行时\",\"primary\":\"硬件数据流 + 计算/控制模块设计 + 架构 + 运行时调度/并发/流水线\",\"secondary\":\"软件栈/算法\"}\n\nNow I need to follow the workflow:\n\n### Step 1: 语义分割\n\nLet me break down Q5.2 into logical chain nodes:\n\nS1: \"硬件控制模块（指令调度 / warp scheduler / DMA控制器 / 命令处理器）\" — 控制模块类型和功能\nS2: \"访存架构（多级Cache / HBM / 共享内存 / 寄存器文件 / Scratchpad）\" — 存储层次组件\nS3: \"如何支持多算子/微算子并发的调度、同步和数据供给\" — 并发调度机制\nS4: \"关键设计方法\" — 设计方法和范式\n\nNow let me create query matrices for each node and search across the 4 directories.\n\nLet me start with parallel searches across all four directories for each node. I'll begin with Level A (long match/composite queries).\n\nFor S1 (控制模块): \"warp scheduler\" \"DMA controller\" \"command processor\" \"instruction dispatch\"\nFor S2 (访存架构): \"memory hierarchy\" \"HBM\" \"shared memory\" \"register file\" \"scratchpad\"\nFor S3 (并发调度同步): \"multi-operator concurrency\" \"synchronization\" \"data supply\" \"barrier\" \"double buffering\"\nFor S4 (关键设计): \"hardware architecture design method\" \"memory coalescing\" \"data prefetching\"\n\nLet me start the searches. I'll do Level A searches for each node across all 4 directories.","signature":"800cd0af-a615-4bfd-951a-886249dfcbd1"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":21156,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f854a06b-a347-4d6d-b919-0558fa9309bb","uuid":"4540295c-af53-4449-9d66-a217985fb14f"}
