ch\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":963},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1005}],\"excerpt\":\"## SM Partitioning（SM分区）/ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）\\n术语是什么？\\nSM Partitioning（也称GPU Spatial Multiplexing）是一种将GPU的流式多处理器(SM)按空间划分为多个独立子集的技术，每个子集可同时执行不同的计算任务。与时间多路复用(Time Multiplexing)不同，空间多路复用允许多个kernel或计算阶段在同一时刻真正并行执行。\\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语：\\nSM分区在GPU硬件层面的运转：\\n1. **GPU的SM组织结构**：以H200 (Arch 9.0)为例，共有132个SM，通过GPC (Graphics Pro…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls.md\",\"basename\":\"GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls\",\"score\":1003.2151955237586,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp.pc\",\"warp发出ldg\",\"warp:\",\"scheduler\",\"scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令（a100:\",\"scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令\",\"scheduler的两种主要stall类型。scoreboard\",\"scheduler的两种主要stall类型\",\"scheduler，每cycle最多issue\",\"gpu\",\"warp scheduler\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp scheduler\",\"offset\":108},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":61},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":104},{\"match\":\"warp scheduler\",\"offset\":108},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":259},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":309},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":341},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":439},{\"match\":\"warp scheduler\",\"offset\":443},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":466},{\"match\":\"warp scheduler\",\"offset\":493},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":536},{\"match\":\"Warp Scheduler\",\"offset\":547},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":593},{\"match\":\"warp.PC\",\"offset\":627},{\"match\":\"Warp发出LDG\",\"offset\":888},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1114},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1196},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1729}],\"excerpt\":\"GPU Scoreboard Stall和Throttle Stall是NVIDIA GPU warp scheduler的两种主要stall类型。Scoreboard stall发生在warp需要等待data dependency（如global memory load未完成，register file data未就绪），指令无法issue因为操作数不可用。Throttle stall发生在warp需要的执行单元（如FP32 unit、Tensor Core、LD/ST unit）正被其他warp占用，指令无法issue因为硬件资源繁忙。两者之和代表了GPU因指令级依赖和结构竞争而无法发射指令的cycles占比。\\n从