cksize），不涉及后者（纯硬件，无法从launch stage影响）\n4. **闭源限制**：由于dispatch unit闭源，现有intra-SM sharing work（CCWS/Prema/PriorityRR）只能通过simulator验证修改，无法在真实NVIDIA GPU上部署。μShare的non-intrusive approach是唯一在真实GPU上可行的方案\n涉及论文标题：\n- μShare: Non-Intrusive Kernel Co-Locating…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate).md","basename":"UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)","score":1435.455170269207,"foundWords":["warp","warp:","warp-level","scheduler","gpu","warp scheduler"],"matches":[{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":2351},{"match":"Warp-level","offset":18},{"match":"warp","offset":90},{"match":"GPU","offset":115},{"match":"warp","offset":456},{"match":"warp:","offset":558},{"match":"warp","offset":2046},{"match":"GPU","offset":2307},{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":2351}],"excerpt":"UWMMA 需要 GPU SM 侧扩展：instruction decoder 新增 opcode 解析、warp scheduler 支持 UWMMA 指令分发。软件编译时，程序员通过类似 CUDA PTX inline assembly 的方式嵌入 UWMMA 指令序列。数据路径要求 register file 提供足够 operand port（Ampere 类需每线程每周期最多 16 个 FP64 source + 4 个 FP64 destination operands）。BBC 格式矩阵的 ValPtr_Lv2 指针在 stc.load 时直接传入 Uni-STC 硬件 buffer，后续 task generation 通过指针索引而非逐元素搬运。\n涉及论文标题：\n- Uni-S…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels (GPU注意力Kernel的软件流水线).md","basename":"Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels (GPU注意力Kernel的软件流水线)","score":1288.9817700887456,"foundWords":["warp","warp**：对已加载的","warp**：使用","scheduler","gpu","gpu注意力kernel的软件流水线","warp scheduler"],"matches":[{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":572},{"match":"GPU","offset":27},{"match":"GPU注意力Kernel的软件流水线","offset":50},{"match":"GPU","offset":154},{"match":"Warp","offset":332},{"match":"warp**：使用","offset":372},{"match":"warp**：对已加载的","offset":485},{"match":"GPU","offset":568},{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":572},{"match":"Warp","offset":719},{"match":"Warp","offset":804},{"match":"GPU","offset":1455},{"match":"warp","offset":1535}],"excerpt":"…) **Consumer warp**：对