ffset":816},{"match":"warp","offset":836},{"match":"GPU","offset":884},{"match":"GPU","offset":951},{"match":"GPU","offset":1174},{"match":"GPU","offset":1466},{"match":"GPUs","offset":1655}],"excerpt":"SM Occupancy（流多处理器占用率）是衡量 GPU 计算资源实际利用程度的指标。它定义了在一个 SM 上同时驻留的 active warp 数量与该 SM 最大可支持 warp 数量的比值。SM occupancy 不同于 GPU utilization——后者仅表示 GPU 是否有任何 kernel 在运行（binary indicator），而 SM occupancy 精确反映 SM 上有多少计算单元（thread/warp）真正处于活跃状态。\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语：\nHuntKTm 揭示了 SM occupancy 在 memory-intensive kernel 场景下的关键洞察：即使 GPU utilization 为…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md","basename":"Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER)","score":83.18340789154253,"foundWords":["warp","schedulers","gpu","gpu:","warp scheduler"],"matches":[{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":1249},{"match":"GPU:","offset":1017},{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":1249}],"excerpt":"// V100: 80 SMs × 4 warp schedulers × 32 threads = 128 min parallelism\n      num_parallel_tiles = total_elements / tile_size\n      if num_parallel_tiles < hardware_parallelism:\n        extra_traffic *= (hardware_parallelism / num_parallel_tiles)\n      \n      // Penalty 3: Capacity check\n      footprint = MemFootprint(g…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/NVIDIA Ampere Architecture (NVIDIA Ampere 架构).md","basename":"NVIDIA Ampere Architecture (NVIDIA Ampere 架构)","score":80.42452188740292,"foundWords":["warp","scheduler","gpu","warp scheduler"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":122},{"match":"GPU","offset":322},{"match":"GPU","offset":355},{"match":"Warp Scheduler","offset":761},{"match":"gpu","offset":1887},{"match":"GPU","offset":1926}],"excerpt":"NVIDIA Ampere 是 NVIDIA 的第八代 GPU 微架构（2020 年发布，SM 8.0），代表产品包括 A100、A40、RTX 3090 等。Ampere 在 AI 推理方面引入了多项关键创新：(1) **第三代 Tensor Cores**：原生支持 TF32/FP16/BF16/INT8/INT4/INT1 混合精度计算，以及 2:4 结构化稀疏（Sparse Tensor Cores）；(2) **Multi-Instance GPU (MIG)**：将单个 A100 切分为最多 7 个独立 GPU 实例；(3) **HBM2e 内存**：A100 最高 80GB，带宽 2 TB/s；(4) **PCIe 4.0 + NVL…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Unified Sparse Tensor Core (Uni-STC).md","basename":"Unified Sparse Tensor Core (Uni-STC)","score":78.87406952170082,"foundWords":["warp","scheduler","gpu","warp scheduler"],"matches":[{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":1315},{"match":"GPU","offset":92},{"match":"GPU","offset":529},{"match":"warp scheduler","offset":1315},{"match":"GPU","offset":1784}],"excerpt":"硬件集成要点：SM 需更新 instruction decoder 解析 UWMMA opcode，扩展 warp scheduler 分发指令。数据交互通过 register file 和 operand collector 完成。两层 Benes/MUX network 主要搬运控制信息（T4 code）而非全量数值数据。面积评估：在 A100 类 826 mm² die 上 432 个 Uni-STC 单元额外面积约 0.0425 mm²（~2.12%），critical path 满足 1.5 GHz。\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\nUni-STC 通过 UWMMA 指令序列由软件驱动：`stc.load` 同步收集 BBC 格式的 metadata 和 values 到硬件 buff…"}],"totalCount":25,"truncated":false},"effectiveQuery":"path:knowledge_notes \"warp scheduler\" GPU"}}}
