{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_cO73SwlIW9O1h7BAJ29R2261","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hopper TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator).md\",\"basename\":\"Hopper TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator)\",\"score\":8861.576678286903,\"foundWords\":[\"tma\",\"tensor\",\"memory\",\"accelerator\",\"hopper\",\"tensor memory accelerator\",\"tma\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"Tensor Memory Accelerator\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Tensor Memory Accelerator\",\"offset\":48},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":75},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":89},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":130},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":146},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":160},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":181},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":187},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":223},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":244},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":305},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":329},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":459},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":499},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":560},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":587},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":621},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":653},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":725},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":763},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":994},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1035},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1136},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1150},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":1195},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1210},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1301},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1374},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":1417},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":1528},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1655},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1695}],\"excerpt\":\"## Hopper TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator)\\n术语解释\\nTensor Memory Accelerator (TMA) 是 NVIDIA Hopper (SM90) 架构引入的专用硬件数据搬运单元，负责在 global memory 和 shared memory 之间高效传输 tensor 数据，无需占用线程执行资源。TMA 是 Hopper 架构中实现异步计算流水线的关键硬件组件。\\n术语是什么？\\nTMA 是独立于 CUDA core 和 Tensor core 的硬件单元，通过 `cp.async.bulk` PTX 指令编程。关键特性：\\n- 单个线程发…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) — Hopper_Blackwell GPU.md\",\"basename\":\"TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) — Hopper_Blackwell GPU\",\"score\":8559.721939818657,\"foundWords\":[\"tma\",\"tma：\",\"tma。triton\",\"tma_store\",\"tensor\",\"memory\",\"accelerator\",\"hopper\",\"hopper_blackwell\",\"hopper/blackwell\",\"hopper,\",\"tensor memory accelerator\",\"tma\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Tensor Memory Accelerator\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"Hopper/Blackwell\",\"offset\":37},{\"match\":\"Tensor Memory Accelerator\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":105},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":224},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":237},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":272},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":539},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":567},{\"match\":\"TMA：\",\"offset\":603},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":611},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":664},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":737},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":804},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":963},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1045},{\"match\":\"tma_store\",\"offset\":1105},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1188},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1516},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1562},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1603},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1707},{\"match\":\"TMA。Triton\",\"offset\":1761},{\"match\":\"Hopper,\",\"offset\":1828},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1867},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1892},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1964}],\"excerpt\":\"## TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) — Hopper/Blackwell GPU\\n术语解释\\nTensor Memory Accelerator (TMA) 是 NVIDIA Hopper (H100) GPU 引入的专用硬件拷贝引擎，支持 GMEM-HBM 与 SMEM 之间的异步批量张量数据传输，无需经过寄存器文件。\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTMA 支持 1D-5D tensor 双向传输，核心特性：(1) 单线程发起——一个线程发出 TMA transfer，其余线程可继续计算；(2) 无寄存器…\"},{\"fil