令，其余线程可继续计算\\n- **无寄存器中转**：数据直接在 GMEM 和 SMEM 之间移动，不经过寄存器（与 A100 的 `cp.async` 相比减少寄存器压力）\\n- **硬件加速 barr…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md\",\"basename\":\"Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined)\",\"score\":365.79073244859245,\"foundWords\":[\"tma\",\"tma（tensor\",\"tensor\",\"memory\",\"accelerator\",\"accelerator）硬件单元\",\"hopper\",\"tensor memory accelerator\",\"tma\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":165},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":476},{\"match\":\"TMA（Tensor\",\"offset\":492},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":503},{\"match\":\"Accelerator）硬件单元\",\"offset\":510},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":1692},{\"match\":\"TMA\",\"offset\":1716},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1873},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1996},{\"match\":\"Hopper\",\"offset\":3033}],\"excerpt\":\"Software Pipeline（软件流水线）是 TileLang 中的 T.Pipelined 调度原语，用于将循环体内的数据搬移（如 global→shared memory copy）与计算（如 GEMM/attention）重叠执行，通过异步硬件机制隐藏内存延迟。TileLang 的 Pipeline 机制自动分析循环体内语句的 buffer 使用依赖关系，生成结构化的 interleaved schedule：将前后相邻 iteration 的 Copy 和 GEMM 交错执行（Copy(i+1) 与 GEMM(i) 重叠）。在不同 GPU 架构上自动选择最优硬件路径：(1) Ampere (A100) — cp.async 异步 global→shared copy + cp.async.commit_group + cp.async.wait…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block-Sparse Row (BSR) Attention Kernel.md\",\"basename\":\"Block-Sparse Row (BSR) Attention Kernel\",\"score\":322.9155888225335,\"foundWords\":[\"tma\",\"tma，sparse\",\"tensor\",\"tensor,\",\"memory\",\"accelerator\",\"hopper\",\"tensor memory accelerator\",\"tma\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":808},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":834},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":952},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1051},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1091},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1107},{\"match\":\"tensor,\",\"offset\":1395},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1914},{\"match\":\"tma\",\"offset\":2050},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":2351},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":3029},{\"match\":\"tma\",\"off