Memory Copy (async-copy) 是 NVIDIA Ampere 架构（A100, Compute Capability 8.0）引入的硬件加速异步数据搬移机制，底层 PTX 指令为 `cp.async`（硬件实现为 LDGSTS）。该机制允许 GPU thread 发起 global memory → shared memory 的数据传输后立即继续执行后续指令，数据搬移在后台由专用硬件（类似 SM 内的 DMA engine）异步完成。支持 4/8/16 字节的 copy 粒度，1…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS.md","basename":"CUTLASS","score":410.9275796328193,"foundWords":["tma","tma/dma","tensor","memory","memory:","accelerator","hopper","hopper+","tensor memory accelerator","tma"],"matches":[{"match":"Tensor","offset":331},{"match":"memory:","offset":1078},{"match":"memory","offset":1114},{"match":"Hopper+","offset":1560},{"match":"TMA/DMA","offset":1613},{"match":"Hopper","offset":1791},{"match":"TMA","offset":1807},{"match":"Tensor Memory Accelerator","offset":1812}],"excerpt":"…d triple-loop nest：最外层CTA级tile循环（计算output tile，沿k轴迭代）、中间warp级tile循环（warp内的矩阵乘）、最内层instruction级MMA操作（Tensor Core或CUDA Core）。CUTLASS提供data-movement和multiply-accumulation类，允许用户在GPU线程层次的所有级别组合自定义GEMM-like计算。\n从编译框架角度拆解术语：\nCUTLASS的工作流程（以GEMM kernel为例）：\n```\n开发者编写 CUTLASS kernel:\n  1. 定义 ElementA/ElementB/ElementC 数据类型 (e.g., half, float)\n  2. 选择 TileShape (e.g., 128×128×32 for FP16→32 GEMM)\n  3. 配置 War…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Dot-Product Engine (DPE) in HLX.md","basename":"Dot-Product Engine (DPE) in HLX","score":373.21165408266404,"foundWords":["tma","tma-based","tma（warp-specialized","tensor","memory","accelerator","hopper","tensor memory accelerator","tma"],"matches":[{"match":"Tensor Memory Accelerator","offset":1853},{"match":"TMA","offset":1880},{"match":"Hopper","offset":1894},{"match":"memory","offset":1939},{"match":"memory","offset":1961},{"match":"tensor","offset":1987},{"match":"TMA","offset":1999},{"match":"TMA","offset":2040},{"match":"tensor","offset":2243},{"match":"Tensor","offset":2275},{"match":"memory","offset":2375},{"match":"tensor","offset":2403},{"match":"TMA","offset":2513},{"match":"Hopper","offset":2552},{"match":"TMA","offset":2562},{"match":"TMA","offset