存延迟。TileLang 的 Pipeline 机制自动分析循环体内语句的 buffer 使用依赖关系，生成结构化的 interleaved schedule：将前后相邻 iteration 的 Copy 和 GEMM 交错执行（Copy(i+1) 与 GEMM(i) 重叠）。在不同 GPU 架构上自动选择最优硬件路径：(1) Ampere (A100) — cp.async 异步 global→shared copy + cp.async.commit_group + cp.async.wait…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block-Sparse Row (BSR) Attention Kernel.md","basename":"Block-Sparse Row (BSR) Attention Kernel","score":322.9155888225335,"foundWords":["tma","tma，sparse","tensor","tensor,","memory","accelerator","hopper","tensor memory accelerator","tma"],"matches":[{"match":"memory","offset":808},{"match":"tensor","offset":834},{"match":"tensor","offset":952},{"match":"memory","offset":1051},{"match":"memory","offset":1091},{"match":"tensor","offset":1107},{"match":"tensor,","offset":1395},{"match":"tensor","offset":1914},{"match":"tma","offset":2050},{"match":"memory","offset":2351},{"match":"Tensor","offset":3029},{"match":"tma","offset":3147},{"match":"Tensor","offset":3536},{"match":"Memory","offset":4211},{"match":"Tensor","offset":4408},{"match":"memory","offset":4586},{"match":"TMA","offset":4605},{"match":"TMA","offset":4621},{"match":"Tensor Memory Accelerator","offset":4626},{"match":"memory","offset":4668},{"match":"TMA，sparse","offset":4751},{"match":"memory","offset":4818},{"match":"Hopper","offset":4990}],"excerpt":"BSR 相比 CSR 的优势：(1) 在 GPU 上 BSR 提升 register reuse efficiency——block 内元素在 shared memory 中 contiguous 排列，适合 tensor core MMA 指令的 dense 操作；(2) 可跳过整个零 block 减少计算；(3) 当 block size 对齐硬件 MMA 指令维度（如 NVIDIA mma 最小 16×16）时，可直接利用 dense tensor core 路径。FlashInfer 的 BSR attention 支持更小的 block size（如 (1,1) vector sparsity），通过先将分散的 global memory tiles gather 到 contiguous shared memory 再用 dense t…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashMLA.md","basename":"FlashMLA","score":279.11666987797116,"foundWords":["tma","tensor","memory","accelerator","hopper","tensor memory accelerator","tma"],"matches":[{"match":"Hopper","offset":134},{"match":"Hopper","offset":663},{"match":"TMA","offset":676},{"match":"Tensor Memory Accelerator","offset":681},{"match":"TMA","offset":914},{"match":"tma","offset":1177},{"match":"tma","offset":1239},{"match":"tma","offset":1262},{"match":"tma","offset":1351},{"match":"Hopper","offset":1811}],"excerpt":"FlashMLA 是 DeepSeek 开源的高效 MLA (Multi-head Latent Attention) decode kernel，专为 Hopper 架构（H100/H800/H200）GPU 优化。GitHub: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/FlashMLA。FlashMLA 实现了 MLA 的 Layer Reordering 优化，在 decode 阶段的 Score 和 Context 计算中通过复用压缩 KV Cache ($\\mathbf{C}_{\\text{KV}}$) 将 ArI 从 ~100 Op/B 提升至 ~200 Op/B（翻倍）。核心优化：Score 层从 HBM 加载 $\\mathbf{C}_{\\text{KV}}$ 后，Context 层立即复用共享内存中的 $\\…"}],"totalCount":10,"truncated":false},"effectiveQuery":"path:knowledge_notes \"TMA\" \"tensor memory accelerator\" Hopper"}}}
