el for GPU Kernel Analysis（面向GPU Kernel分析的计算强度与Roofline模型）","score":2142.838333300798,"foundWords":["memory","memory-efficient","memory-bound","hierarchy","gpu","gpu的roofline分析","gpu硬件上ci的计算依赖于具体memory","gpus","hbm","hbm-level","l1","l1-level","l2","l2/l1-level","cache","memory hierarchy"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":49},{"match":"GPU","offset":71},{"match":"GPU","offset":196},{"match":"memory-bound","offset":235},{"match":"memory-bound","offset":328},{"match":"memory","offset":564},{"match":"memory-bound","offset":657},{"match":"GPU硬件上CI的计算依赖于具体memory","offset":748},{"match":"hierarchy","offset":771},{"match":"HBM-level","offset":791},{"match":"memory","offset":849},{"match":"L2/L1-level","offset":870},{"match":"cache","offset":893},{"match":"HBM","offset":1071},{"match":"memory-bound","offset":1290},{"match":"memory-bound","offset":1441},{"match":"GPU的Roofline分析","offset":1588},{"match":"memory","offset":1824},{"match":"memory-bound","offset":1867},{"match":"Memory-Efficient","offset":2080},{"match":"GPUs","offset":2343}],"excerpt":"## Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model for GPU Kernel Analysis（面向GPU Kernel分析的计算强度与Roofline模型）\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCompute Intensity (CI) = FLOPs / Bytes Transferred，是Roofline模型的X轴参数，用于判断GPU kernel是compute-bound（高CI，受限于峰值算力）还是memory-bound（低CI，受限于内存带宽）。Roofline模型在log-log或线性坐标中画出两条上界：(1) 斜线：performance = bandwidth × CI（memory-bound ceiling）…"}],"totalCount":5,"truncated":false},"effectiveQuery":"path:knowledge_notes \"memory hierarchy\" GPU HBM L1 L2 cache"}}}
