et":39},{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":696},{"match":"modality","offset":1371},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":1974},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":2041}],"excerpt":"## Softmax Temperature Calibration for Cross-Modal Similarity（跨模态相似度的Softmax温度校准）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nSoftmax Temperature Calibration 是 MMTok 中用于对齐 text-vision 和 vision-vision 相似度矩阵分布的技术。由于 T-V 相似度（基于投影后对齐 LLM embedding 的 vision tokens 与 text tokens 的内积）和 V-V 相似度（基于投影前的原始 vision tokens 的内积）具有不同的量纲和分布形状，直接相加会导致一个覆…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐).md","basename":"Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐)","score":551.0383247528833,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","cross-modality","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Modality","offset":3},{"match":"Cross-Modality","offset":82},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":1401},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":1471}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCross-Modality Alignment（跨模态对齐）是多模态大模型训练的第一阶段（Alignment Stage），目标是将不同模态（图像、视频、音频、语音等）的编码器输出映射到统一的 LLM 语言表示空间，使 LLM 能\"理解\"非文本模态的输入。该阶段仅训练模态连接器（Connector），冻结编码器和 LLM，通过最小化生成文本的交叉熵损失来学习模态-语言映射。\nUni-MoE 的跨模态对齐阶段针对每种模态独立执行：(1)…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal.md","basename":"Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal","score":405.6532727317018,"foundWords":["cross","cross-scan","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Scan","offset":3},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":41},{"match":"Cross-Scan","offset":97},{"match":"Cross-Scan","offset":227},{"match":"Modal","offset":1221}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) 是MVSS模块中的另一种2D扫描策略，将视觉patch特征沿四个对角线方向展开为1D序列并分别送入Mamba-2层处理。四个方向包括：左上→右下、右下→左上、右上→左下、左下→右上。CSM借鉴VMamba的Cross-Scan Module设计思想——对角线方向扫描可以捕获传统行列扫描难以建模的斜向空间关系（如物体的对角线边界、纹理等）。与BSM（2个方向…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture.md","basename":"Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture","score":389.9285036607352,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","modality-","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Attention","offset":3},{"match":"Cross-Attention","offset":55},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":112},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":225},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":264},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":587},{"match":"cross","offset":679},{"match":"cross","offset":724},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":803},{"match":"cross-attentio","offset":1070},{"match":"cross-attentio","offset":1113},{"match":"Modality","offset":1286},{"match":"Multimoda","offset":1349}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture\n术语是什么？\nCross-Attention LMM 是多模态大模型的第二种主流架构，在 LLM backbone 中插入专用 cross-attention layers 处理 image tokens。大部分层保持原有 self-attention（仅处理 text tokens），少数层（如 Llama3.2-11B 中 4/40 层）被替换为 cross-attention layers——text tokens 通过 cross-attention attend to image tokens，…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modal Cache（模态缓存）.md","basename":"Modal Cache（模态缓存）","score":382.09435245583967,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","modal","modality-specific","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Modal","offset":3},{"match":"Modal","offset":30},{"match":"modality-specific","offset":90},{"match":"Modal","offset":193},{"match":"Modal","offset":310},{"match":"modal","offset":407},{"match":"modal","offset":444},{"match":"Modal","offset":491},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":932},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":983},{"match":"Modal","offset":1505},{"match":"modal","offset":2040},{"match":"modal","offset":2152},{"match":"modal","offset":2199},{"match":"modal","offset":2261},{"match":"Modal","offset":2333},{"match":"Modal","offset":2805},{"match":"Modal","offset":2925},{"match":"Modal","offset":3005},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":3054}],"excerpt":"## Modal Cache（模态缓存）\n术语是什么？\nModal Cache 是 EEVEE 提出的面向多模态模型 serving 的模块级中间结果缓存机制，用于存储和复用 modality-specific modules 的推理输出以消除跨请求重复计算。与传统 LLM serving 中仅用于加速 autoregressive decoding 的 KV Cache 不同，Modal Cache 缓存的是跨请求可共享的模块输出——主要是 visual encoder 产生的 visual tokens 或对应的 KV pairs，使后续引用同一图像/视频/音频的请求可直接复用而无需重跑 e…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md","basename":"Any-to-Any Multimodal Models","score":44.30185799166577,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","cross-stage","modal","modality-specific","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"multimodal","offset":138},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":14},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":52},{"match":"multimodal","offset":138},{"match":"multimodal","offset":344},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":815},{"match":"multimodal","offset":1022},{"match":"Modality-specific","offset":1105},{"match":"Modality-specific","offset":1275},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":1406},{"match":"Modality-Specific","offset":1447},{"match":"modality-specific","offset":1504},{"match":"cross-stage","offset":1868},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":2190}],"excerpt":"Any-to-Any Multimodal Models 是能够接受和生成多种模态（text、image、video、audio）的统一模型架构。与传统的 text-to-text LLM 或 multimodal-input text-output 模型不同，any-to-any 模型支持交叉模态的端到端训练和理解-生成的统一。代表性模型包括：Qwen-Omni 系列（text+image+video+audio 输入，text+audio 输出）、GLM-Image（text+image 输入，text+image 输出）、BAGEL（Mixture-of-Transformers 设计，分离 multimodal understanding 和 visual generation experts）、LongCat-Flash-Omni（560B MoE LLM backbone…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Attention Merging（注意力合并）.md","basename":"Attention Merging（注意力合并）","score":41.542816525512094,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention（system","cross-attention","cross-modal","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"cross-attention","offset":161},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":266},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":305},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":853},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":1227},{"match":"cross","offset":1274},{"match":"cross-attention（system","offset":1539},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":1705},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":1964},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":2110},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":2145}],"excerpt":"Attention Merging 是 VisiPruner (EMNLP 2025) 提出的一种训练无关的视觉 token 压缩技术：在 MLLM 推理时，将某层的所有视觉 cross-attention weights 强制合并/聚焦到单个视觉 token 上，从而在保持 attention 分布稳定性（避免 softmax 归一化崩塌）的同时，将 N_text × N_v 的 cross-attention 计算降为 N_text × 1。具体操作：在 cross-attention matrix A ∈ R^{N_text × N_v} 上，对每一行 i（对应每个文本 token），将分散在所有视觉 token 上的 attention weights 求和后全部赋给一个随机选定的视觉 token k，其余位置的权重置零：A^{(l)}_{i,j} = Σ_…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）.md","basename":"Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）","score":37.75575525100014,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","cross-modal","modal","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"cross-modal","offset":133},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":498},{"match":"modality","offset":2206},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":2421},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":2456}],"excerpt":"Vision Exit（视觉退出）是 VisiPruner 提出的 MLLM 深层优化策略：在 cross-modal fusion 完成后的某一层（称为 vision exit layer ℓ_exit），将所有保留的视觉 token 从后续层中移除，使深层仅做纯文本语言 refining。其核心发现是：MLLM 的深层（LLaVA-v1.5 7B 中约 layer 26+）已不再依赖视觉 token——跨模态信息已在中间层充分集成到文本表示中，继续保留视觉 token 不仅无益，反而引入噪声。实验证据：(1) 从 layer 26 起 discard 所有视觉 token，GQA 几乎不变（61.95→61.91）；(2) 但如果 skip layer 26 的视觉处理却继续在后续层…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Attention Sink（注意力汇）.md","basename":"Attention Sink（注意力汇）","score":35.917682698550756,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","cross-modal","modal","modality-specific","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"modality-specific","offset":3238},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":3460},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":4590},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":4625},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":4719}],"excerpt":"…ass 流向 value norm 极小的 token，类似 bias term；(3) 浅层 layer 1 中视觉和文本 token 的 value vector 分布迥异（Fig. 7），需要 modality-specific sink；layer 2+ 文本 token（如 system prompt）即可替代视觉 token 作为 attention sink；(4) 移除浅层视觉 sink token 后，attention mass 会自动重新分配到文本 sink token（App. E.2），进一步证实 sink 的\"结构稳定\"角色而非信息传递角色。VisiPruner 利用这一发现，在 layer 1 将所有视觉 cross-attention 合并到单个随机 token 作为 attention sink，layer 2+ 完全跳过视觉 attention，保持性能…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Adaptive Gating for Multimodal Attention Fusion（自适应门控多模态注意力融合）.md","basename":"Adaptive Gating for Multimodal Attention Fusion（自适应门控多模态注意力融合）","score":35.87381500597009,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention（视觉补充信息）的输出。与","cross-attention","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Multimodal","offset":23},{"match":"cross-attention（视觉补充信息）的输出。与","offset":183},{"match":"_cros","offset":514},{"match":"cross-attentio","offset":532},{"match":"_cros","offset":681},{"match":"-Moda","offset":1427}],"excerpt":"## Adaptive Gating for Multimodal Attention Fusion（自适应门控多模态注意力融合）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nAdaptive Gating 是 mPLUG-Owl3 提出的基于文本语义的门控机制，用于融合 self-attention（文本内信息）和 cross-attention（视觉补充信息）的输出。与 Flamingo 的固定 learnable scale 不同，Adaptive Gating 通过文本特征自身计算门控值 `g = Sigmoid(W_gate^T · H_text)`，使得每个 token 可以根据其…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MI-Rope (Multimodal-Interleaved Rotary Position Embedding，多模态交织旋转位置编码).md","basename":"MI-Rope (Multimodal-Interleaved Rotary Position Embedding，多模态交织旋转位置编码)","score":35.55902708522056,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attend","cross-attention","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Multimodal","offset":12},{"match":"cross-attend","offset":406},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":1025},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":1459},{"match":"Modal","offset":1787}],"excerpt":"## MI-Rope (Multimodal-Interleaved Rotary Position Embedding，多模态交织旋转位置编码)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nMI-Rope 是 mPLUG-Owl3 提出的用于多图交织场景的位置编码方法。核心思想：在图像-文本交织输入中，每张图的所有 patch tokens 共享该图在文本序列中占位符 T_img 的 RoPE 位置编码。与 MRoPE（Qwen2.5-VL，使用 3D (T,H,W) 位置 ID）不同，MI-Rope 仅使用 1D 位置 ID——即文本序列中的 token 索引位置。这…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Influence-based Token Pruning（基于影响力的Token剪枝 _ Value-aware Token Selection）.md","basename":"Influence-based Token Pruning（基于影响力的Token剪枝 _ Value-aware Token Selection）","score":28.57399678679126,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","cross-modal","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"cross-attention","offset":2281},{"match":"cross","offset":2397},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":2759},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":2794}],"excerpt":"…，对 attention weights 做 per-token masking 后重算 output。关键实现细节：(1) 仅需评估最后一个文本 token（idx=-1）对各视觉 token 的 cross-attention 影响——因为解码从该 token 开始，其 attention output 直接决定首个生成 token；(2) 在 attention weights 层面 mask（设 W'_{i→j}=0 across all heads），而非直接删除 token（后者会改变序列长度和 positional encoding）；(3) 评估在单层内完成——不需要 propagate 到后续层（与 leave-one-out 方法相比大幅节省计算）。该方法在 multiple MLLM architectures（LLaVA-v1.5 7B/13B, InternVL2…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Query-based Vision Token Compression（基于可学习Query的Vision Token压缩）.md","basename":"Query-based Vision Token Compression（基于可学习Query的Vision Token压缩）","score":27.794350523892888,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention:","cross-attention","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"cross-attention","offset":190},{"match":"modality","offset":324},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":513},{"match":"Cross-attention","offset":981},{"match":"Cross-attentio","offset":1356},{"match":"，cross-attentio","offset":1698},{"match":"_Multimoda","offset":2205}],"excerpt":"Query-based Vision Token Compression 是 LMM 中一种通过可学习 query 向量与 vision token 进行 cross-attention 来压缩视觉信息的技术。LLaVA-Mini (Zhang et al., 2025) 将其推向极致——将 CLIP ViT-L 输出的 576 个 vision token 压缩到仅 1 个 token（压缩率 0.17%），同时通过 modality pre-fusion 弥补压缩带来的信息损失，性能与 LLaVA-v1.5 可比。核心机制：(1) 引入 C×C 个可学习压缩 query Q^v（默认 C=1，即 1 个 query）；(2) 对 query 和原始 vision token 施加 2D sinusoidal positional encodi…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multimodal Connector _ Projector in MLLM.md","basename":"Multimodal Connector _ Projector in MLLM","score":27.110593379726698,"foundWords":["cross","crossattention","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Multimodal","offset":3},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":96},{"match":"cross","offset":277},{"match":"CrossAttention","offset":691},{"match":"Modal","offset":1561}],"excerpt":"## Multimodal Connector / Projector in MLLM\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\n多模态连接器（Multimodal Connector / Projector）是MLLM中位于视觉编码器和LLM之间的模块，负责将视觉特征映射到LLM的embedding空间，并可能对视觉特征进行进一步处理（如序列压缩、空间关系建模）。最简单的连接器是3层MLP（如LLaVA-1.5），更复杂的包括Q-Former（BLIP-2，使用learnable queries通过cross-attention压缩视觉token）、…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE.md","basename":"Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE","score":25.972147750638694,"foundWords":["cross","cross-entropy","modalities","modality","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"Multimodal","offset":47},{"match":"modality","offset":189},{"match":"modalities","offset":332},{"match":"modality","offset":484},{"match":"cross-entropy","offset":521},{"match":"modality","offset":561},{"match":"modalities","offset":803},{"match":"modality","offset":845},{"match":"modality","offset":1253},{"match":"modality","offset":1382},{"match":"modalities","offset":1527},{"match":"modality","offset":2019},{"match":"cross-entropy","offset":2132},{"match":"Modality","offset":2353}],"excerpt":"## Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nExpert Generalization and Specialization 是 Flex-MoE 提出的两阶段 SMoE 训练策略，用于在 missing modality 场景下让每个 expert 同时具备通用知识和专有知识。灵感来自课程学习——先用\"简单\"样本（全模态）学习通用知识，再用\"困难\"样本（部分模态）学习专有知识。\n- **Generalization 阶段（warm-up epochs）**：仅使用全模态样本（all modalities obse…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Token Sensitivity-Aware KV Cache Management.md","basename":"Token Sensitivity-Aware KV Cache Management","score":24.856021008733027,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","modal","multimodal"],"matches":[{"match":"M Cross-Mod","offset":1566},{"match":"t Multimod","offset":1633}],"excerpt":"- FlowMM Cross-Modal Information Flow Guided KV Cach